Details worth quoting accurately:

- **Tire installation** includes mounting, computer balancing, valve stem replacement, TPMS inspection and reset, and torque to the manufacturer's spec. Balancing is included, not an add-on. Old tires are taken away and recycled. Tires bought elsewhere, including online, can be fitted at the same rate.
- **Flat tire repair** is a permanent internal patch-plug applied with the tire off the rim, warrantied for the life of the tire. An external plug is not offered as a repair. Punctures in the sidewall or shoulder, larger than about 6 mm, already repaired in the same spot, or on a tire driven flat, cannot be safely repaired.
- **Seasonal changeover** is the {{ p_change }} job when the seasonal set is already on its own rims. If both sets share one set of rims, that is tire installation instead, because each tire must be dismounted and rebalanced.
- **Re-torque** at 50–100 km after any wheel is removed is free.

